  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-7fSl7neL\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wdRi79sW\">通过此接口，可查询营销账号下的所有预算组信息。</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-KTYN28wq\"><br/></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-07QwQf8s\" id=\"h346b9f0-07QwQf8s\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">注意</span></h1><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-Jqn65TJl\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Q6q3eG1k\">目前白名单开放，如需使用请联系对应销售</li></ol>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201777641004212236%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-fMcSnRa2\" id=\"h346b9f0-fMcSnRa2\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-b0k2iVta\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/budget_group/list/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/budget_group/list/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1780644067911818\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-TCWYaPpx\" id=\"h346b9f0-TCWYaPpx\">请求方法</h1><p dat