-id=\"ld70c578-wyY4rdab\"><code>PROCEDURAL</code> 自动投放模式</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">ad_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DvbtTt91\">营销类型 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-lk6CR1TX\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-U0udgIyB\"><code>ALL</code> 通投</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YnteyEK5\"><code>SEARCH</code> 搜索</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">budget_group_status_first</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WV75K7zl\">预算组聚合一级状态 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-ZbQHK0pc\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hPNby0aG\"><code>DELETED</code> 已删除</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hlcE1Egd\"><code>ENABLE</code> 启用中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-foDBwJEE\"><code>UNDELIVERIED</code> 未投放</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">budget_group_status_second</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cXmffZS4\">预算组聚合二级状态 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-dWjSj3aY\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2Jk0vOh0\"><code>ACCOUNT_EXCEEDED</code> 账户超出预算</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HlUn6KXE\"><code>GROUP_EXCEEDED</code> 预算组超出预算</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow